{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Flush queued replay completions before their live parent closes.** If an external operation started in an earlier invocation completes through `onOperationChange` while its replayed child context is active but is not awaited, the child span is removed before this loop runs. The continuation is then incorrectly attached to `Invocation`. Before finalizing a non-replay `CONTEXT`, drain pending direct children as the execution view does, and test a prior-invocation unawaited callback or invoke.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-EQ8x","finding_digest":"348bd242cb2b9d9fdacdec86063a522393cd8f70b3c337c4d81d0110d6159d33","finding_id":"arf_v1_gsf5eqwlfooz7wwn5sdamosseo","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::replayed-child-completion-parent","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::replayed-child-completion-parent","line":270,"observation_digest":"7166c3a154cece6c394f88b44ab7005fded7c99323ad878bf5f7dd890b769c56","observation_id":"aro_v1_oftmhikuz3hgyokprc2evnyal7","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kzxp7vt5lvpz3ub6fqkp2wcw4s","reviewed_base_sha":"89011d8369d00ba0f6ddb49d850f73d1e864d96d","reviewed_head_sha":"60295b7375ffd570073dbfb6132c4b891af7d6a3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":269,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_of4bybwqbld6fs7tcyzpasxpyk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
